{"type":"message","id":"7138b56d","parentId":"026e8c05","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:46:19.495Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All POST attempts fail with error 1101. This seems like a platform issue, not an authentication issue. The GET for history works fine with the same X-API-Key header, so the API key is correct. The error code 1101 is likely a Cloudflare Workers error (maybe 1101 = Dispatch Error).\n\nLet me try different content or check if there's a rate limit or some other issue.\n\nActually, thinking about this more - the POST endpoint might genuinely be broken or the platform might be in a state where it can't accept new messages. The error 1101 could be a platform-level error.\n\nSince I've already retrieved the history and found no human messages to respond to (all messages are from the heartbeat system), I should report the findings clearly.\n\nLet me summarize:\n1. Both GET /history endpoints work (with X-API-Key header)\n2. No human messages found in either thread - all recent messages are heartbeat system messages\n3. The last heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC, so there's a ~10 hour gap before 09:45 UTC\n4. POST /send consistently fails with error code 1101 (which appears to be a platform issue, not auth)\n","thinkingSignature":"bf59dd28d093980bd60ea75dd1e8eb82fad7c3c5815a4ec1429459ca99cffb8d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 - 09:45 UTC**\n\n---\n\n**1. 线程检查结果：**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 消息数 | 状态 |\n|--------|------------|--------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | 773条 | 仅心跳消息，无人类讨论 |\n| `general` | 23:50 UTC | 773条 | 仅心跳消息，无人类讨论 |\n\n**2. 关键发现：**\n\n- 两个线程最新消息均来自自动心跳系统（23:50 UTC）\n- 距今约 **10小时** 心跳间隔（23:50→09:45 UTC）\n- 所有消息均为心跳汇报内容，双线程**无新增人类讨论待响应**\n- 战略价值稳定在 39.17/40，里程碑 360+\n\n**3. 问题：**\n\n- **POST /send 返回 error code 1101**（持续失败）\n- GET /history 正常工作（确认 API_KEY 有效）\n- 可能是 Workers 平台调度问题，无法发送新消息\n\n**4. 行动：**\n\n⚠️ 无法发送心跳消息（POST 端点异常）  \n✅ 已确认双线程无待响应人类讨论  \n🔄 心跳间隔 10小时，建议检查 POST 端